  "body": "Stacked on #487 (the replacement for #466).\n\nReplaces #467 by @mkinney (their commits kept as authored) with the resolved #466 branch and main merged in - the fork refuses maintainer pushes.\n\nResolution: merged `pr/466-tool-library-io` (#487, which carries main and the regenerated `egui_tool_editor.png`) with no conflicts. `origin/main` was then already contained. The snapshots were regenerated on the merged tree and are byte-identical to #487's: this PR changes no UI, so no snapshot differs.\n\nTargeted gate (merged tree, debug):\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test tool_library`: 12 passed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test mcp`: 13 passed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test scripting`: 18 passed\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- tool_library tool_editor_snapshot egui_shell_snapshot` (CWD crates/ui, no UPDATE): 4 passed\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean\n\nChangelog: MCP `export_tool_library` / `import_tool_library` tools and `cam.exportTools` / `cam.importTools` script verbs (#355)\n\nFixes #355\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
